{"4090730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sengodai", "steam_appid": 4090730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4384220], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sengodai expands with new content!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090730/extras/e1fbe4c988d074c0b4294efe3298cfed.avif?t=1782230013\" width=940 height=258 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👹🃏 <strong>New Gokai</strong> · Five new Gokai cards join the collection!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐉⚡<strong>Ishigon</strong> · A new playable Elemental God!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗡️🆚 <strong>Duel Mode</strong> · A challenge suitable only for the most expert duelists!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️🏯 <strong>Tower of Gods</strong> · Sengodai's biggest challenge yet!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, expand and evolve your deck to explore an ever-changing world!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sengodai is a tactical roguelike deckbuilder where you collect and create your Gokai monsters team to explore diverse worlds and challenge the cursed gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore an ever-changing world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090730/extras/c23552e847c9f4d1d2755d8d018176d5.avif?t=1782230013\" width=940 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a new journey every time you play! Choose your path, find new Gokai, face unique enemies, uncover powerful spells, and forge your deck to challenge the Cursed Gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and evolve your team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090730/extras/3e1e2d287c66181515d9aa0907999427.avif?t=1782230013\" width=940 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Gokai cards, create a unique team, and upgrade them to make powerful synergies with your team leader, an Elemental God!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master your god skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090730/extras/3834191a87fa36b3f1193d6a05667855.avif?t=1782230013\" width=940 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master different Elemental Gods with unique skills and playstyle to lead your team to victory using the divine power of your chosen deity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash spells to dominate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090730/extras/aef0593b9bb941dafbbc826609a67dd8.avif?t=1782230013\" width=940 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alter the course of the battle with arcane spells! Draw them from your opponents or buy them from an enigmatic merchant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Control the elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090730/extras/505f2583b53a5607dd49392c56109eed.avif?t=1782230013\" width=940 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge your Gokai with elements to purify the Cursed Lands and reduce your opponent’s life to zero to claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sengodai comes with:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign mode with 5 worlds to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random-generated world paths with different duels, merchants and sculptors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Gods (4 unlockable) with their own gameplay style and skill set.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Gokai cards to collect and evolve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ Spell cards.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sengodai expands with new content!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090730/extras/e1fbe4c988d074c0b4294efe3298cfed.avif?t=1782230013\" width=940 height=258 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👹🃏 <strong>New Gokai</strong> · Five new Gokai cards join the collection!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐉⚡<strong>Ishigon</strong> · A new playable Elemental God!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗡️🆚 <strong>Duel Mode</strong> · A challenge suitable only for the most expert duelists!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️🏯 <strong>Tower of Gods</strong> · Sengodai's biggest challenge yet!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, expand and evolve your deck to explore an ever-changing world!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sengodai is a tactical roguelike deckbuilder where you collect and create your Gokai monsters team to explore diverse worlds and challenge the cursed gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore an ever-changing world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090730/extras/c23552e847c9f4d1d2755d8d018176d5.avif?t=1782230013\" width=940 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a new journey every time you play! Choose your path, find new Gokai, face unique enemies, uncover powerful spells, and forge your deck to challenge the Cursed Gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and evolve your team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090730/extras/3e1e2d287c66181515d9aa0907999427.avif?t=1782230013\" width=940 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Gokai cards, create a unique team, and upgrade them to make powerful synergies with your team leader, an Elemental God!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master your god skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090730/extras/3834191a87fa36b3f1193d6a05667855.avif?t=1782230013\" width=940 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master different Elemental Gods with unique skills and playstyle to lead your team to victory using the divine power of your chosen deity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash spells to dominate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090730/extras/aef0593b9bb941dafbbc826609a67dd8.avif?t=1782230013\" width=940 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alter the course of the battle with arcane spells! Draw them from your opponents or buy them from an enigmatic merchant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Control the elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090730/extras/505f2583b53a5607dd49392c56109eed.avif?t=1782230013\" width=940 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge your Gokai with elements to purify the Cursed Lands and reduce your opponent’s life to zero to claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sengodai comes with:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign mode with 5 worlds to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random-generated world paths with different duels, merchants and sculptors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Gods (4 unlockable) with their own gameplay style and skill set.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Gokai cards to collect and evolve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ Spell cards.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Collect and create your Gokai monsters team in this tactical roguelike deckbuilder! Build, expand and evolve your deck to explore an ever-changing world.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Indonesian, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian, Catalan, Galician, Polish, Thai, Arabic, Hindi", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090730/14e094b79eb18e7e8f6333d0d7ce641550cab031/header.jpg?t=1782230013", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090730/ce71856299d69fe3a502231d63d172bdd50707bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782230013", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090730/ce71856299d69fe3a502231d63d172bdd50707bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782230013", "website": "https://sengodai.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</stro